-- ============================================================
SELECT * FROM letter.user_permissions('a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002')
    ORDER BY on_table, privilege, column_name, scope_table, scope_id;
 role  | privilege |    on_table     | column_name | scope |   scope_table   |               scope_id               | using_path | check_fn 
-------+-----------+-----------------+-------------+-------+-----------------+--------------------------------------+------------+----------
 admin | delete    | public.projects | *           |       | public.projects | b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001 |            | 
